🧠 Introduction

AI models become more useful when users can interact with them through a UI.

Gradio is a Python framework used to quickly create web interfaces for AI models.

👉 With Gradio, you can build:

✔ Chatbots
✔ Image generators
✔ Text summarizers
✔ Speech recognition apps
✔ RAG interfaces

Without writing frontend code.

---

# 🔹 What is Gradio?

```text id="gradio_def"
A Python library for creating interactive web interfaces for machine learning and AI applications
```

---

🎯 Why Use Gradio?

✔ Very easy to use
✔ Fast prototyping
✔ No frontend knowledge required
✔ Shareable web apps
✔ Works well with AI/LLMs

---

⚙️ Installation

```bash id="gradio_install"
pip install gradio
```

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🧪 Basic Gradio App

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

💻 Example: Hello World

```python id="gradio_hello"
import gradio as gr

def greet(name):
    return f"Hello, {name}!"

interface = gr.Interface(
    fn=greet,
    inputs="text",
    outputs="text"
)

interface.launch()
```

---

🔄 Workflow

```text id="gradio_flow"
User Input → Python Function → Model Processing → Output
```

---

🧩 Core Components

| Component     | Purpose                     |
| ------------- | --------------------------- |
| Interface     | Simple UI wrapper           |
| Blocks        | Custom layouts              |
| ChatInterface | Chatbot UI                  |
| Components    | Textbox, Image, Audio, etc. |

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

💬 Building a Chatbot UI

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

💻 Example

```python id="gradio_chatbot"
import gradio as gr

def chatbot(message):
    return f"You said: {message}"

demo = gr.ChatInterface(fn=chatbot)

demo.launch()
```

---

🖼️ Input & Output Components

Gradio supports many components:

* Textbox
* Image
* Audio
* Video
* File Upload
* Dropdown
* Slider

---

💻 Example: Image Input

```python id="gradio_image"
import gradio as gr

def process_image(image):
    return image

demo = gr.Interface(
    fn=process_image,
    inputs=gr.Image(),
    outputs=gr.Image()
)

demo.launch()
```

